Modifications
-------------

Asylum has been modified from Zed continuously since 2025. The changes
include, among others: embedded iOS simulator and Android emulator, embedded
web preview (Chromium Embedded Framework), API client, database client,
Docker and Elasticsearch docks, task agents and pipelines, the Asylum Agent
(token usage reductions and dock interaction), GitHub and ClickUp
integrations, its own icon family, and removal of the dependencies on
Zed Industries' hosted services.

The complete history of changes is available in the git history of
https://github.com/viniengelage/asylum, which is also where the
Corresponding Source for every published build can be found (each release
is tagged).

